How this repository is licensed
-------------------------------

Upstream ships NO repository-level licence file, so there is no single licence to inherit and
Choice cannot grant one over PancakeSwap's code. **Each file's SPDX header governs that file.**
Upstream's mix, unchanged here:

  GPL-2.0-or-later    the protocol source, including src/UniversalRouter.sol
                      Copyright (C) 2024 PancakeSwap
  GPL-3.0-or-later    parts of src/modules/
  MIT                 parts of src/ and the libraries
  UNLICENSED          upstream's own deploy scripts under script/

Because GPL-3.0-or-later files are present, a combined work built from this repository is
conveyed under GPL-3.0-or-later. Choice's own contracts do not import anything from here -
`choice_v2_contracts` imports only infinity-core and infinity-periphery, both
GPL-2.0-or-later - so that combination does not arise there. What Choice deploys from this
repository is upstream's UniversalRouter, unmodified.

